## Scope of This License

This license applies to the LegalDown specification document and all
content in this repository, including examples, templates, and schemas.

This license does NOT apply to software implementations of the LegalDown
specification. Parsers, renderers, editors, validators, and any other
tools that implement the LegalDown specification may be released under
any license their authors choose, independently of this license.

